project_name: Wheel of Productivity
stack:
  language: TypeScript (strict), ESM modules
  ui: Vanilla HTML/CSS, Canvas API
  storage: Session cookies only (no localStorage/sessionStorage)
  hosting: Static (GitHub Pages workflow included)
rules:
  - Do not add frameworks or bundlers. Use tsc only.
  - Keep build output in public/js; source in src/.
  - Maintain accessibility: keyboard operable, ARIA live announcements, reduced motion support.
  - Use semantic HTML and keep CSS minimal and responsive.
  - Prefer explicit types; avoid any.
  - Avoid external CDNs and third-party scripts.
  - Write complete code; no placeholders.
  - Use absolute paths in docs and instructions.
testing:
  - Manual: open /public/index.html in a browser and test add/spin/delete/reset flows.
  - Typecheck: npm run typecheck (in CI).
conventions:
  - Filenames: kebab-case for static assets; camelCase for TS exports.
  - Keep functions small; pure where possible.
  - Do not store sensitive data in cookies; session-only data should be small.